# A packaged build should be the extension and nothing else. `git archive -o dist.zip HEAD` honours these
# lines, so the zip that goes to the store carries no repository paperwork. A plain `zip -r` or Chrome's
# "Pack extension" ignores this file, in which case exclude the same four paths by hand.
/ARCHITECTURE.md  export-ignore
/README.md        export-ignore
/.gitignore       export-ignore
/.gitattributes   export-ignore
